  - m_Id: 934273088
    m_Localized: Show stats
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273089
    m_Localized: Place your bet (LMB)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273090
    m_Localized: When you bet on a number, you are also betting on its dozen, color
      and the number itself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273091
    m_Localized: Each of these has its own multiplier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273092
    m_Localized: You can cancel a bet (RMB)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273093
    m_Localized: Your goal is to beat the quota
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273094
    m_Localized: Spin the roulette
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273095
    m_Localized: You can finish the bet by clicking a ball, or spin again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273096
    m_Localized: The first reroll is free; after that you lose 25% of the winnings
      for each new spin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273097
    m_Localized: You won! Finish the bet by pressing the button
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273098
    m_Localized: Find the shop, you can buy upgrades there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273099
    m_Localized: With the golden chips you earn you can buy special chips, more silver
      for betting, food and balls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273100
    m_Localized: Each category has its own limits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273101
    m_Localized: There are only 5 chip slots, choose wisely
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273102
    m_Localized: Food in the shop is restocked after every third quota
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273103
    m_Localized: The price of silver goes up with every purchase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273104
    m_Localized: Only two balls are available every 3 quotas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273105
    m_Localized: After shopping, return to the table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273106
    m_Localized: After every third quota you get an extra reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273107
    m_Localized: You got a boss chip, find the plaque shrine to spend it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 934273108
    m_Localized: A plaque is an upgrade that changes the board, choose wisely
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1472416889954304
    m_Localized: DEADLY ROULETTE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
